  "notes": {
    "goals": "Goal ids are unique per family; `avoid` lists features the goal would leave unused (the level ends before they matter); `kind` names the objective kind when it differs (the rescue family's 'clear the pass' is clear_zones, defend's 'train N defenders' is hire). `needs` lists features the goal requires (@two_goods: at least two sellable goods). `anchor`: the goal puts a pad on the bot's plan that anchored features can hang their pads from.",
    "features": "`anchor` features add pads the bot only buys when they sit on its plan, so they need an anchoring goal. `with` pulls in companion features (salvage upgrades need turrets, tier 2 needs the material processor).",
